{"3802050": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Timeless Artifact: mechAnubis", "steam_appid": 3802050, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in the body of Anubis in an &quot;ancient&quot; pyramid with no memory of who or what you are. Explore the pyramid and try to survive its challenges and discover what is going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No decks, no rouges, just an old school action-adventure.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/0142a581309b702774acbab0326d6b40.poster.avif?t=1760304648\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/0142a581309b702774acbab0326d6b40.webm?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/0142a581309b702774acbab0326d6b40.mp4?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARE YOU A ROBOT?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No, a robot is a machine that operates automatically. You control this machine, which makes it a mech. Which means you are Mechanubis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/a019928b127fade046e5902bba435c44.poster.avif?t=1760304648\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/a019928b127fade046e5902bba435c44.webm?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/a019928b127fade046e5902bba435c44.mp4?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TWO SHIELDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever seen anyone use two shields at once? They have modifiable functions and you can literally launch them from your arms. They can be used to block enemy attacks as well, obviously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/9385fbe7dbe0c7775e7164c209cd59b8.poster.avif?t=1760304648\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/9385fbe7dbe0c7775e7164c209cd59b8.webm?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/9385fbe7dbe0c7775e7164c209cd59b8.mp4?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT OTHER ROBOTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, your enemies are robots that are based on Egyptian mythology. Face off against many different types of robots (at least three). Use your abilities and your environment to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/06fea9d7ec3df1e636bfe32d46ffbd79.poster.avif?t=1760304648\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/06fea9d7ec3df1e636bfe32d46ffbd79.webm?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/06fea9d7ec3df1e636bfe32d46ffbd79.mp4?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLATFORMING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many platforming elements such as jumping. Also wall running, grappling, ledge climbing. Movement is (mostly) physics based so you might be able to do some crazy moves?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/979b2b86f8755bcf2cdce63fc3fa16c1.poster.avif?t=1760304648\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/979b2b86f8755bcf2cdce63fc3fa16c1.webm?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/979b2b86f8755bcf2cdce63fc3fa16c1.mp4?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THERE ARE PUZZLES TOO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Might be too many. They are also (mostly) physics based but physics may freak out. Please don't break the simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/8475e2461088bb3b0924e1f2dd62302b.poster.avif?t=1760304648\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/8475e2461088bb3b0924e1f2dd62302b.webm?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/8475e2461088bb3b0924e1f2dd62302b.mp4?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up in the body of Anubis in an &quot;ancient&quot; pyramid with no memory of who or what you are. Explore the pyramid and try to survive its challenges and discover what is going on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No decks, no rouges, just an old school action-adventure.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/0142a581309b702774acbab0326d6b40.poster.avif?t=1760304648\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/0142a581309b702774acbab0326d6b40.webm?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/0142a581309b702774acbab0326d6b40.mp4?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ARE YOU A ROBOT?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No, a robot is a machine that operates automatically. You control this machine, which makes it a mech. Which means you are Mechanubis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/a019928b127fade046e5902bba435c44.poster.avif?t=1760304648\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/a019928b127fade046e5902bba435c44.webm?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/a019928b127fade046e5902bba435c44.mp4?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TWO SHIELDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever seen anyone use two shields at once? They have modifiable functions and you can literally launch them from your arms. They can be used to block enemy attacks as well, obviously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/9385fbe7dbe0c7775e7164c209cd59b8.poster.avif?t=1760304648\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/9385fbe7dbe0c7775e7164c209cd59b8.webm?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/9385fbe7dbe0c7775e7164c209cd59b8.mp4?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT OTHER ROBOTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, your enemies are robots that are based on Egyptian mythology. Face off against many different types of robots (at least three). Use your abilities and your environment to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/06fea9d7ec3df1e636bfe32d46ffbd79.poster.avif?t=1760304648\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/06fea9d7ec3df1e636bfe32d46ffbd79.webm?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/06fea9d7ec3df1e636bfe32d46ffbd79.mp4?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLATFORMING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many platforming elements such as jumping. Also wall running, grappling, ledge climbing. Movement is (mostly) physics based so you might be able to do some crazy moves?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/979b2b86f8755bcf2cdce63fc3fa16c1.poster.avif?t=1760304648\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/979b2b86f8755bcf2cdce63fc3fa16c1.webm?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/979b2b86f8755bcf2cdce63fc3fa16c1.mp4?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THERE ARE PUZZLES TOO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Might be too many. They are also (mostly) physics based but physics may freak out. Please don't break the simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/8475e2461088bb3b0924e1f2dd62302b.poster.avif?t=1760304648\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/8475e2461088bb3b0924e1f2dd62302b.webm?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/extras/8475e2461088bb3b0924e1f2dd62302b.mp4?t=1760304648\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "A sci-fi action-adventure in which you take control of a robotic Anubis with two shields. Explore the pyramid, go through challenging trials and uncover secrets in this experimental journey.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802050/16351a5411859e560b0de3d2884f8e69ff2186d7/header.jpg?t=1760304648", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.ste